Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth Episode\NThe Phantom Ship\NDance Franz
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, no! It's dangerous!\NDon't do it! You'll get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.06,0:02:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, governess!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens, Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not do these things!\NWait! You'll break your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hurt yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well...!\N- I've got you, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Today a ball will be held on a ship!\NGo and change your clothes immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No! You know that if there's one thing\NI detest, it's dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I inform you that Prince Franz\Nof Terradoro has arrived among us...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...privately!\N- This is a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound the trumpets!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this how you enjoy welcoming\Na guest in these parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to have some fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you,\NPrince Sapphire! I am Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The pleasure is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and start dancing,\NPrince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like dancing.\NI will watch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's postpone the pleasantries\Nuntil later!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you liked dancing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I especially like watching\Nthe dancers! I'll see you from up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is a nice boy,\Nbut I think he's teasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Boys, behave! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.02,0:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Nylon,\Nstop playing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know why we are here.\N- Don't worry, Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Very soon we will verify\Nthat Sapphire is a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,even if she behaves\Nlike a tomboy. I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, in the meantime, how they are\Ntying up those two brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly! My idea is to\Ninvolve Prince Frank...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the dilemma and have\Nhim investigate in our place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he going? Let's wait and see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Nylon, what did you\Nwant to tell me that is so secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make you aware\Nof something very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, the matter\Nconcerns Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:06:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows whether\Nhe is a boy or a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I thought\Nof turning to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, help me discover\Nthe secret of Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.06,0:06:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not known if it is\Na boy or a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Really interesting!\NAlright, I accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sapphire! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Nylon is plotting\Nto discover your secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, bon appétit, Sapphire! But I\Nsee that you certainly don't lack that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, someone told\Nme that you have a peculiarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon told him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did I fall? I am\Nnear the rowers' benches!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Row!\NCome on, wimps!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be sissies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:07:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning and night, always rowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No one hopes to avoid the whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!\NI'll show you, lazybones!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning and night, always rowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No one dares defy the whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.82,0:07:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No one dares defy the whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning and night, always rowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- No one dares defy the whip.\N- Harder! Row, you slackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.06,0:07:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning and night, always rowing.\NNo one hopes to avoid the whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor souls! I wonder why they work\Nchained up like that..! Really strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.18,0:07:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning and night, always rowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.78,0:07:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, lazybones! If you\Ndon't row, I won't feed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.50,0:07:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'm so thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- What a strange mouse!\N- Did you say I'm a mouse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No! For your information,\NI am an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:08:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you serious?\NDon't tell me you're a real angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! And you are chained up because\Nyou did something bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, down there!\NWhat are you grumbling about? Row!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear? Now stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm retiring to eat!\NDon't make the slightest noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, what did you do\Nto end up inside this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys,\Nthis little one is an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to tell him the truth\Nabout what brought us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- And you will judge...\N- ...if we deserved...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.26,0:08:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...to lead this life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we didn't do\Nanything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We refused to bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We refused to bow at the\Npassage of Grand Duke Duralumin,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so the soldiers chained us up\Nand brought us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Row! Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get moving!\NStart rowing again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start singing again, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning and night, always rowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will burn us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I am an angel\Nand I must help these poor souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Franz, I don't like\Ndancing or singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must dance,\Nwhen you are invited!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Sapphire? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me, Sapphire! Listen!\N- What is it, Tink? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- I have to tell you something important.\N- So, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,May I? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent! And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He has more important\Nthings to do, than dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning and night, always rowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth, Sapphire!\NYou don't want to speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not a Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't hide it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,From the way you\Ndance you seem like a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I forbid you to say these things!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want to fight?\N- No! You know, I hate fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, here, you\Nare the real sissy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?\NMe, a sissy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- We'll see about that! En garde!\N- En garde yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I don't think\Nthis is the right time to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worse than a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're strong for a girl!\N- When will you understand that I'm a boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll make you understand it clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you two! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave us alone! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire's voice is becoming\Nmore and more like a girl's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.06,0:11:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think so too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! Yes!\NKeep going, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done! Well done! Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What an effort to break these chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, angel! I will\Nnever forget your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, friends! Let's rebel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- From now on, we won't row anymore!\N- What?! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!\NWhat did you do with the chains?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go above deck!\N- We are free!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've made\Na mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll beat you!\N- It won't be easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- We can make our move!\N- Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And you take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Sapphire!\NIt's a mutiny! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get out of the way! What do you want to do?\N- You'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so violent?\NStop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, brat,\Nor you'll see how you end up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no!\N- Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, it's dangerous to stay\Non deck! Let's take shelter elsewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.22,0:12:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I want to stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:13:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Help! I can't swim!\N- Now, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Forward!\N- Get them! Let's catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, they are soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- We will sell our hides dearly!\N- Get them! Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's retreat! To the control room!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.90,0:13:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, boys! Let's set\Na trap! Open the hull!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up or it will be worse for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll all end up hanged!\NSurrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All set!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Damn it!\N- We did it! Let's go ashore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! There were other soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.06,0:14:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid slaves! You will pay dearly\Nfor your rebellion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Princess, why don't\Nwe stop and shake hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a princess! Get\Nthat through your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not talk about it anymore! Instead, I\Nwonder how we are going to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, up on deck\Nthey are fighting furiously!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The prisoners are in revolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- We won't go back in chains!\N- Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Damn it!\N- Stop right where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.10,0:14:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you break the chains?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! They are not to blame! You shouldn't\Nhave chained them up for so little!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from, Your Highness? I\Nthought they had thrown you into the sea too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As for these rebels,\NI know what they deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.46,0:14:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't hurt them!\N- They are good people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They only refused\Nto bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?\N- A friend of... Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, proceed\Nwith the execution of the rebels!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Commander, proceed!\N- Let the execution begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But this sound is..!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,These drums announce\Nthe execution of a sentence!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, it's true. - Why is it\Nthat you don't want to keep your promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What promise? I don't remember\Nmaking any promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I only know that those rebels\Ndeserve death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell my father that Grand Duke\NDuralumin is a big liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.30,0:15:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and tell him!\NHere is the Decree with his seal
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...authorizing the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the people!\NLet them witness the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it to serve as an example!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That Grand Duke is really wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.82,0:16:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way is to try\Na surprise action!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello!\N- Prince Franz?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed you\Nbecause I cannot allow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...that a girl ends up\Ngetting into trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen: I already told\Nyou that I'm not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.78,0:16:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shut up! Leave it to me!\NDon't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do\Neverything you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you're cute and I\Nreally like that little face of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.66,0:16:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's just me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Proceed!\N- Plank over the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin,\Nwe are proud to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.22,0:17:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We are proud of not\Nhaving bowed before you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve nothing but contempt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.62,0:17:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready with the plank!\NPull it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No one?! Don't talk nonsense!\NThe cannon doesn't fire on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.14,0:17:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Search! Search the whole ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Search for the traitor\Nlurking among us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Found nothing? We need\Nmore energy! Keep searching! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:17:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! This ship is haunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you having fun?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the traitors! Search\Nfrom top to bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship is vibrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Vi... Vi... Vibrating!\NIt's all vibrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship is moving, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How can it be moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the ship immediately!\NDon't let it head out to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it in the harbor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But... how fast\Nthis ship is going!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What devilry is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.18,0:18:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If the ship doesn't\Nstop, we cannot proceed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no one at the oars!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to understand what caused\Nthe ship to break its moorings!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.22,0:19:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god! On the\Nship there are evil spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnificent! The\Nsoldiers are already afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here!\N- Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be useful to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's a cursed ship!\N- Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's the ghosts\Nmaking the ship move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why no one is at the\Noars and the ship goes so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.30,0:19:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We will defeat the ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That one is firing the cannon!\NI'm getting out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.66,0:19:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You bunch of cowards!\NChase that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You bunch of cowards,\Nchase that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretend nothing is wrong,\Nboys. Now we will untie you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you look in here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.90,0:19:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ghost, are you in\Nthere? He is not answering!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never believed in ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghosts have\Nfreed the prisoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we are the ghosts!\NCome on, boys! Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the soldiers!\NIt's over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to\Nslaughter us! Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There, now we'll let you in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.82,0:20:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- I stopped in time!\N- You think so? Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair! I slipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.86,0:20:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you from the bottom of my heart for\Neverything that you have done, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you that the ghost\Nprank was quite amusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship of Grand Duke Duralumin\Nis following ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to fight again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, be careful!\NYou might fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.30,0:20:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolphin friends,\Nyou were so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.30,0:21:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the dolphins!\NThey are the ones pulling the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Row! Soon we will catch up to them!\NPush on the oars!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.46,0:21:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They are going too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We are too fast\Nfor that ship to catch up to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so, everyone, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.90,0:21:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're listening! We're with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.66,0:22:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that you\Nfeel the same way I do:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.70,0:22:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,we no longer want to fawn over\Nthose who tyrannize us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.26,0:22:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say we go to other\Nlands to enjoy a free life?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We will never be slaves again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bradamante and the others are leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.78,0:22:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go say goodbye to them!\NNot so loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.10,0:22:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You are truly a good Prince,\NSapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.62,0:22:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.42,0:23:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must leave too.\NGoodbye, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.66,0:23:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye to you, Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.90,0:23:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for you.\NTake it as a keepsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.42,0:23:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A flower? What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.54,0:23:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to guess the secret\Nlanguage of flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You say it's secret?
